{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415039","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415039","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041503901:1":{"text":"やあ、友よ。久しぶりに会ったが、相変わらずつまらなさそうな顔をしているな。","source_cn":"老朋友，这么长时间没见，你没有变啊，依然如此……无趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x970F9DD608B21C5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503902:1":{"text":"ふん、浮わついた青二才が。","source_cn":"哼，轻浮的小子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C828EDFC88D1350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503903:1":{"text":"酒を飲む以外に、お前がまともなことをしているところを見たことがない。","source_cn":"你每天除了喝酒还是喝酒，吾从没见你干过什么正事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEC76970662E3D95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503904:1":{"text":"若者の悪い手本になっている自覚はないのか？","source_cn":"对于年轻人，你实在是个太坏的榜样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A6EB3F186FBFD13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503905:1":{"text":"やれやれ、君は時間の貴重さを分かっていない。だからいつまでも古臭い音楽を奏でているんだ。","source_cn":"顿里尔，你从不懂光阴珍贵，只知道拨弄你那些陈腐的乐章。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B65432802426A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503906:1":{"text":"お前の教えに賛同する哀れな若者たちこそ、人生の時間を無駄にしている。","source_cn":"如果哪个年轻人听了你的教诲，才是不幸提前踏上了生之暮路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2B34DDF9D03F6AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503907:1":{"text":"サジタリスよ、己の軽薄さと愚かさを少しは自覚したらどうだ。","source_cn":"萨基塔里斯，你不仅轻浮，而且愚蠢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x972F73440617CFC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503908:1":{"text":"時代遅れで狭量な君に言われたくないな。","source_cn":"顿里尔，你不仅迂腐，还肚量狭隘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38A5E2AF2E3AC3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041503909:1":{"text":"正直な考えを口にしたまでなのに、それを「軽薄で愚か」と一蹴するような君にはね。","source_cn":"我只不过诚实地说出了自己的想法，就被你盖上了轻浮愚蠢的帽子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0DCAC352569E52F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041503910:1":{"text":"まあそうカッカするな。我は酒を楽しみに来たのであって、君と争う気はない。","source_cn":"放轻松，我是来小酌的，不是来法庭争辩的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47C7118EDEB40EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041503911:1":{"text":"ふん、相変わらずよく回る口だな。","source_cn":"哼，搬弄口舌的雀鸟都不如你会说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDC3BD689311F6D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041503912:1":{"text":"お褒めにあずかり光栄だよ。","source_cn":"那可真是谢谢夸奖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB974946AD1B05EEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041503913:1":{"text":"お前がいると分かっていたら、家で曲でも書いたほうが有意義だったな。","source_cn":"早知道你在，吾不如回去谱乐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x257903A0912C79E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041503914:1":{"text":"君の作る曲は素晴らしいよ。壮大かつ情熱的で、聴く者を奮い立たせる力がある。","source_cn":"说真的，我很欣赏你的音乐。它们宏大激昂，一听就让人振奋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x436815123DF34917","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041503915:1":{"text":"だが時には、穏やかな調べを挟むことも必要だ。たとえば、今この時のようにな。","source_cn":"但有的时候，你得学会在生活中插入一些舒缓悠闲的小调。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F4FD6372D6E61CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041503916:1":{"text":"……杯で美酒を揺らす喜びの場に、このようなつまらぬ話は不似合いだろう？","source_cn":"就好像此刻……杯中美酒满溢，实在不适合发生这么严肃无趣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83D0F26EA12A8E3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"サジタリス","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:顿里尔":{"text":"ドレアル","source":"顿里尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":2}}